      "text": "It mimics the expressions and motions of those it sees to understand the feelings of others.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "In an attempt to confuse its enemy, it mimics the enemy’s movements. Then it wastes no time in making itself scarce!",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "It habitually mimics foes. Once mimicked, the foe cannot take its eyes off this Pokémon.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "In an attempt to confuse its enemy, it mimics the enemy’s movements. Then it wastes no time in making itself scarce!",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "It habitually mimics foes. Once mimicked, the foe cannot take its eyes off this Pokémon.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It does its absolute best to mimic the movements and expressions of its opponents, but it’s still not very good at it.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "When this gifted mimic surprises an opponent, Mime Jr. feels so happy that it ends up forgetting it was imitating something.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It mimics everyone it sees, but it puts extra effort into copying the graceful dance steps of Mr. Rime as practice.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "It looks for a Mr. Rime that’s a good dancer and carefully copies the Mr. Rime’s steps like an apprentice.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Known to turn up in bustling marketplaces now and again. It mimics people much as a child would, then watches how they react, eyes sparkling.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
